-- Sultan Hussain Ordinance 1904, ss 2, 3 and 4 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_sultan-hussain-ordinance-1904.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

